  "notes": "设备识别与连接诊断更可靠。\n\n- 修复部分设备返回通用硬件标识时被误认为同一设备的问题，设备识别更准确。\n- 账号订阅地址跳转到其他域名时继续完成更新，同时移除设备标识，避免将设备信息发送给第三方。\n- 订阅更新失败时优先显示代理线路的实际原因，诊断可区分每次代理和直连尝试。\n- 修复节点测速自动恢复后仍被记录为失败的问题；崩溃诊断补充组件和应用版本，便于定位故障。\n- 提高 Linux 版本的发布可靠性。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable device recognition and connection diagnostics.\n\n- Fixed devices with generic hardware identifiers being mistaken for the same device.\n- Account subscription updates continue across redirects to another domain while removing device identifiers, keeping device information away from third parties.\n- Failed subscription updates now prioritize the actual proxy connection error, with diagnostics distinguishing each proxy and direct attempt.\n- Fixed automatically recovered node latency tests still being recorded as failures. Crash diagnostics now include component and app version details to help locate faults.\n- Improved Linux release reliability.\n",
